# UR Cutter vs Alurentell. Part D: Cori-Steel Cutter, Murktide Regent, Dragon's Rage Channeler, lands, cantrips, removal.

=== cutter-flurry-second-spell-makes-monk
title: Cori-Steel Cutter: the second spell each turn creates a 1/1 Monk with prowess (first and third spells do not)
ref: Cori-Steel Cutter Oracle (flurry)
state:
  humanbattlefield=Cori-Steel Cutter;Mountain;Mountain;Island;Island
  humanhand=Lightning Bolt;Brainstorm;Ponder
script:
  p1: cast Lightning Bolt -> p2
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: check zone p1 battlefield count "Monk Token" == 0
  p1: cast Brainstorm
  p1: pick Monk Token
  p1: pick no
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: check zone p1 battlefield count "Monk Token" == 1
  p1: cast Ponder
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield count "Monk Token" == 1
  spells p1 == 3

=== cutter-flurry-attach-optional
title: Cori-Steel Cutter flurry: the Cutter may be attached to the new Monk, making it 2/2 with trample and haste
ref: Cori-Steel Cutter Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Cori-Steel Cutter;Mountain;Island
  humanhand=Lightning Bolt;Brainstorm
script:
  p1: cast Lightning Bolt -> p2
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Brainstorm
  p1: pick Monk Token
  p1: pick yes
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  pt p1 "Monk Token" 2/2

=== cutter-flurry-counts-countered-spells
title: Flurry triggers on cast, so a countered second spell still makes a Monk
ref: Cori-Steel Cutter Oracle; CR 603.2 (cast triggers)
state:
  humanbattlefield=Cori-Steel Cutter;Mountain;Island;Island
  humanhand=Lightning Bolt;Brainstorm
  aihand=Force of Will;Brainstorm
script:
  p1: cast Lightning Bolt -> p2
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Brainstorm
  p1: pick Monk Token
  p1: pick no
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Brainstorm
  p2: cast Force of Will ~alt -> Brainstorm
  p2: pick Brainstorm
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield count "Monk Token" == 1
  zone p1 graveyard has "Brainstorm"

=== cutter-flurry-opponent-turn-spells-count
title: Flurry counts spells cast in the opponent's turn: two instants during p2's turn create a Monk
ref: Cori-Steel Cutter Oracle ("each turn")
state:
  activeplayer=p2
  activephase=UPKEEP
  humanbattlefield=Cori-Steel Cutter;Mountain;Island;Island
  humanhand=Lightning Bolt;Brainstorm
script:
  p1: at p2:UPKEEP
  p1: cast Lightning Bolt -> p2
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Brainstorm
  p1: pick Monk Token
  p1: pick no
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield count "Monk Token" == 1

=== murktide-delve-counters
title: Murktide Regent: delving away five cards with three instants/sorceries gives three +1/+1 counters (6/6)
ref: Murktide Regent Oracle; CR 702.66 (delve)
state:
  humanhand=Murktide Regent
  humanbattlefield=Volcanic Island;Volcanic Island
  humangraveyard=Brainstorm;Ponder;Lightning Bolt;Island;Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: cast Murktide Regent
  p1: pick Brainstorm; Ponder; Lightning Bolt; Island; Dragon's Rage Channeler
expect:
  pt p1 "Murktide Regent" 6/6
  counters p1 "Murktide Regent" P1P1 == 3
  zone p1 graveyard size == 0
  zone p1 exile size == 5

=== murktide-delve-only-nonspells-no-counters
title: Murktide Regent: delving a land and a creature gives no counters (3/3)
ref: Murktide Regent Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Murktide Regent
  humanbattlefield=Volcanic Island;Volcanic Island;Island;Island;Island
  humangraveyard=Island;Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: cast Murktide Regent
  p1: pick Island; Dragon's Rage Channeler
expect:
  pt p1 "Murktide Regent" 3/3

=== murktide-grows-when-instant-leaves-graveyard
title: Murktide Regent on the battlefield gets a counter whenever an instant or sorcery card leaves your graveyard (second Murktide delving a Bolt)
ref: Murktide Regent Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Murktide Regent
  humanbattlefield=Murktide Regent;Volcanic Island;Volcanic Island
  humangraveyard=Lightning Bolt;Island;Island;Island;Island
script:
  p1: cast Murktide Regent
  p1: pick Lightning Bolt; Island; Island; Island; Island
expect:
  counters p1 "Murktide Regent" P1P1 >= 1

=== murktide-needs-colored-mana
title: Delve cannot pay for {U}{U}: Murktide Regent cannot be cast with one blue source and a full graveyard
ref: CR 702.66a (delve pays generic mana only)
state:
  humanhand=Murktide Regent
  humanbattlefield=Island
  humangraveyard=Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
script:
  p1: try cast Murktide Regent
  p1: pick all
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Murktide Regent"

=== drc-delirium-needs-four-types
title: Dragon's Rage Channeler: 4 card types in the graveyard make it 3/3 flying; only 3 types do not
ref: Dragon's Rage Channeler Oracle (delirium)
state:
  humanbattlefield=Dragon's Rage Channeler
  humangraveyard=Island;Lightning Bolt;Dragon's Rage Channeler;Lotus Petal
script:
  p1: pass
expect:
  pt p1 "Dragon's Rage Channeler" 3/3
  creature p1 "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== drc-three-types-no-delirium
title: Dragon's Rage Channeler with only three card types in the graveyard stays 1/1
ref: Dragon's Rage Channeler Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Dragon's Rage Channeler
  humangraveyard=Island;Lightning Bolt;Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: pass
expect:
  pt p1 "Dragon's Rage Channeler" 1/1

=== drc-surveil-on-noncreature-spell
title: Dragon's Rage Channeler surveils 1 when you cast a noncreature spell, not a creature spell
ref: Dragon's Rage Channeler Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Dragon's Rage Channeler;Mountain;Island
  humanhand=Lightning Bolt;Acererak the Archlich
  humanlibrary=Brainstorm;Island;Island
script:
  p1: cast Lightning Bolt -> p2
  p1: pick Brainstorm
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Brainstorm"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Lightning Bolt"

=== unholy-heat-delirium
title: Unholy Heat deals 6 with delirium (kills Acererak 5/5) and only 2 without
ref: Unholy Heat Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Unholy Heat
  humanbattlefield=Mountain
  humangraveyard=Island;Lightning Bolt;Dragon's Rage Channeler;Lotus Petal
  aibattlefield=Acererak the Archlich
script:
  p1: cast Unholy Heat -> Acererak the Archlich
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Acererak the Archlich"

=== unholy-heat-no-delirium
title: Unholy Heat without delirium deals only 2 damage (Acererak survives)
ref: Unholy Heat Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Unholy Heat
  humanbattlefield=Mountain
  humangraveyard=Island;Lightning Bolt
  aibattlefield=Acererak the Archlich
script:
  p1: cast Unholy Heat -> Acererak the Archlich
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p2 battlefield has "Acererak the Archlich"

=== prismari-charm-two-targets-damage
title: Prismari Charm mode 2: 1 damage to each of two targets (a Dragon's Rage Channeler and a Recruiter of the Guard, both 1/1, die)
ref: Prismari Charm Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Prismari Charm
  humanbattlefield=Volcanic Island;Mountain
  aibattlefield=Dragon's Rage Channeler;Recruiter of the Guard
script:
  p1: cast Prismari Charm -> Dragon's Rage Channeler; Recruiter of the Guard
  p1: pick deals 1 damage
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"
  zone p2 graveyard has "Recruiter of the Guard"

=== prismari-charm-bounce
title: Prismari Charm mode 3: bounce target nonland permanent
ref: Prismari Charm Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Prismari Charm
  humanbattlefield=Volcanic Island;Mountain
  aibattlefield=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
script:
  p1: cast Prismari Charm -> Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  p1: pick Return target nonland
expect:
  zone p2 hand has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"

=== prismari-charm-surveil-draw
title: Prismari Charm mode 1: surveil 2 then draw a card
ref: Prismari Charm Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Prismari Charm
  humanbattlefield=Volcanic Island;Mountain
  humanlibrary=Island;Brainstorm;Stock Up;Ponder
script:
  p1: cast Prismari Charm
  p1: pick Surveil 2
  p1: pick Island
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Island"
  zone p1 hand has "Brainstorm"

=== wasteland-kills-ancient-tomb
title: Wasteland destroys a nonbasic land (Ancient Tomb)
ref: Wasteland Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Wasteland
  aibattlefield=Ancient Tomb;Island
script:
  p1: activate Wasteland ~destroy -> Ancient Tomb
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Ancient Tomb"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Wasteland"
  zone p2 battlefield has "Island"

=== wasteland-cannot-target-basic
title: Wasteland cannot target a basic land (Island, and Snow-Covered Island)
ref: Wasteland Oracle; CR 305.6 (basic = supertype Basic)
state:
  humanbattlefield=Wasteland
  aibattlefield=Island;Snow-Covered Island
script:
  p1: try activate Wasteland ~destroy -> Island
  p1: try activate Wasteland ~destroy -> Snow-Covered Island
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield has "Wasteland"
  untapped p1 "Wasteland"

=== wasteland-hits-dual-with-basic-types
title: Wasteland can destroy Tropical Island (nonbasic, though it has basic land types)
ref: Wasteland Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Wasteland
  aibattlefield=Tropical Island
script:
  p1: activate Wasteland ~destroy -> Tropical Island
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Tropical Island"

=== wasteland-in-response-tomb-still-taps
title: In response to Wasteland, the target land can still be tapped for mana; the mana is usable
ref: CR 605.3b (mana abilities resolve immediately); Wasteland Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Wasteland
  aibattlefield=Volcanic Island
  aihand=Brainstorm
script:
  p1: activate Wasteland ~destroy -> Volcanic Island
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Wasteland
  p2: cast Brainstorm
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Volcanic Island"
  zone p2 graveyard has "Brainstorm"

=== ancient-tomb-damage
title: Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to its controller when tapped for mana (Stock Up paid with Tomb + Island)
ref: Ancient Tomb Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Stock Up
  humanbattlefield=Ancient Tomb;Island
script:
  p1: cast Stock Up
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  life p1 == 18
  zone p1 graveyard has "Stock Up"

=== ancient-tomb-lethal-tap
title: Tapping Ancient Tomb at 2 life is legal (the controller dies); Forge's AI payment code refuses to do it
ref: Ancient Tomb Oracle; CR 605 (mana abilities can always be activated; the cost is not a life payment)
xfail: FORGE AI LIMITATION, not a rules bug. ComputerUtilMana will not tap a damaging land when the damage would kill, so the enumerator/auto-payer used by the LLM seat cannot offer the line. Rules-wise the player may do it (and lose).
state:
  humanlife=2
  humanhand=Stock Up
  humanbattlefield=Ancient Tomb;Island
script:
  p1: cast Stock Up
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  lost p1

=== city-of-traitors-played-land
title: City of Traitors is sacrificed when you play another land
ref: City of Traitors Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=City of Traitors
  humanhand=Island
script:
  p1: play Island
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "City of Traitors"
  zone p1 battlefield has "Island"

=== city-of-traitors-fetch-is-not-play
title: A fetchland putting a land onto the battlefield is not "playing" a land: City of Traitors stays
ref: City of Traitors Oracle; CR 305.1 (play vs put)
state:
  humanbattlefield=City of Traitors;Flooded Strand
  humanlibrary=Island;Island
script:
  p1: activate Flooded Strand
  p1: pick Island
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield has "City of Traitors"
  zone p1 battlefield has "Island"
  life p1 == 19

